# Formatting and lint on staged files only — under a second in practice.
#
# Deliberately not the test suite. The Worker tests boot workerd and the
# simulator sleeps on purpose, so a full run is closer to a minute — and a
# pre-commit hook that slow gets bypassed with --no-verify the first time
# someone is in a hurry. A hook people routinely skip is worse than no hook.
# Correctness is CI's job; this one only keeps mechanical noise out of the diff.
pnpm exec lint-staged
